---
manual: manip.prepend
lines: [2349, 2363]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @slot = stack { para 'Good Morning' }
  @go = button("Go") { @slot.prepend { para "Your car is ready." } }
end
----------- test code
assert_equal ["Good Morning"], stack("@slot").contents.map(&:text)

button("@go").trigger_click

assert_equal ["Your car is ready.", "Good Morning"], stack("@slot").contents.map(&:text),
  "the para is added at the beginning of the slot"
